abstract: >-
  MATLAB code and processed analysis inputs used to reproduce the figures and
  principal statistical analyses for the study From River Freshwater to
  Near-Surface Stratification: Shelf-Dependent Links to Arctic Summer Sea Ice.
  The archive covers six Arctic river-shelf systems during 1979-2024 and
  includes analyses of river discharge, upper-ocean salinity, near-surface
  haline stratification, summer sea ice, atmospheric controls, spatial-domain
  sensitivity, and temporal variability.
